                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yi ka e’yo agataru eji emi vu engazu emi adripi aku yini ma eselia ’diyi vu, ari ofuza pi ma esele cozu ari ofuza aziniri be, azita pi ma esele cozu e’yo azile azini ’diyi be, aziza pi e’yo liza be, emi ma tre yi dria yi imbazu, e’yo onzi kazu yi ndezu Yehova ma milia ku, azini adra kazu emuzu emi ruaa emi adripi be ku indio Emi ma ’ye ’dini e’yo onzi kazu emi ndezu e’yo liza ma alia ku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
